                                      "key": "rendition_type",
                                      "value": "1024",
                                      "description": "(Required) Rendition size type. thumbnail2x is a small thumbnail, numeric values indicate the longest edge in pixels, and fullsize is the maximum resolution available."
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                "description": "Retrieves a server-generated rendition of the asset at the specified size. Renditions are JPEG preview images generated from the master file with current develop settings applied."
